    "text": "The cover of the WHO SMART Guidelines publication \"Digital adaptation kit for child health (0-59 months) in humanitarian emergencies: operational requirements for implementing WHO recommendations in digital systems,\" carrying the \"SMART GUIDELINES\" banner, icon illustrations of care activities, and the WHO logo. It is one of three example DAK covers shown where the handbook discusses DAKs as a desk-review resource and reviews what DAKs contain.",
